  "key_points": {
    "clinical_trials": "Clinical trials and research studies continue to validate the efficacy of osteoporosis drugs, comparing the effectiveness of different drugs such as bisphosphonates, denosumab, and teriparatide in preventing fractures and improving bone density. Recent findings highlight the long-term benefits of these medications, especially in high-risk populations.",
