  "conclusion": "The increased support for osteoporosis drugs is driven by clinical evidence, patient advocacy, pharmaceutical innovation, and public health policies. As research advances, it is likely that the support for these drugs will grow, leading to better disease management and improved quality of life for those affected."
}

