    "challenges": "bacterium's ability to evade the immune system by entering a persistent state where it remains dormant within host cells, avoiding detection by the immune system",
    "solution": "targeting antigens that are consistently expressed during both the active and persistent phases of the infection"
  },
  "implications": {
